      "claim": "The L5 gut-wall efflux/intestinal-metabolism records concern furosemide, UK-224671, indapamide, felodipine, amlodipine, hydrochlorothiazide, and unrelated compounds, not the query; low absorptive transport or efflux in those molecules is not affirmative evidence for F < 20% in the query.",
      "card_ids": ["C60", "C61", "C62", "C63", "C64", "C65", "C66", "C67", "C68", "C69", "C70", "C71"]
    },
